Now I look at the next garment.
It is a yellow skirt.
This skirt is also made of cotton.
I put on that light skirt.
I look in the mirror.
This skirt is very good.
Its yellow colour pleases me.
So, I check its price.
There is a very high number on the price tag.
This skirt is too expensive.
Its price is too high for me.
I am not buying it.
I am a little sad.
I take off that skirt.
I set it aside.
Afterwards, I pick up the next garment.
